247 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 206 0 R
/E (Frontline health facilities often manage high patient volumes with limited staff time, language barriers, and medical reports in different formats. Patient symptoms, voice inputs, prescriptions, and lab reports often contain fragmented information, missing details, and unclear timelines. These gaps make difficulty in case review and urgency-based prioritization, increasing the workload on healthcare workers. An unified workflow is needed to organize patient information, highlight urgency signals, and prepare structured notes for review by qualified health professionals.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [3]
>>
