342 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 211 0 R
/E (TRAAYA integrates patient-facing web and mobile apps with multimodal intake for symptoms, voice, and medical reports. FastAPI validates inputs and coordinates TraayaBrain, the triage rules engine, and LLM-generated summary drafts. PostgreSQL via Supabase stores case data, while Redis supports caching and session state. Cases flow into a priority queue for nurse or doctor review, with options to request details, edit assessments, refer, or escalate. Human clinicians retain final decision-making authority.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
